{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、今日から3公演の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブが始まります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早い。驚く程早い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ先だなんて思ってたのに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間にこの日が来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、神宮球場ぶりの全員集合。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いものを作りたいと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、ただのライブじゃなくてMerry X'mas Showという名前。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がるだけじゃなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観て楽しんで頂ける場面も多いんじゃないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、showとしても丁寧に頑張らなきゃね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に思い出に残る素敵なクリスマスを過ごしましょうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップリングのランキングも発表になりますし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれるみなさん、応援よろしくね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/13/2514676/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒がインフルエンザにかかってしまった為出演出来なくなってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しい中頑張ってたから体が追いつけなかったのかも...(´._.｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、健康第一というし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何事も体が命。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末まで忙しいだろうからゆっくり休んで治療してね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで生駒の分まで頑張るよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの良い報告待っててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして 今回ライブに参加出来ないよーというみなさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり早めの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマスを写メでお届けするねヽ(*´∀｀)来年は乃木坂46と一緒に過ごそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/13/2514676/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/13/2514676/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、行ってきます。"}],"source":"archive"}